            "question": {
              "content": "A sunflower plant uses sunlight to grow. A bee visits the sunflower to collect nectar. Later, the bee flies back to its hive, using energy to move its wings.\n\nWhich of the following statements accurately describe energy transformations occurring in this scenario? Select all that apply. [[\u2603 radio 1]]",
